 34SI2cDN E(n){-lab} are available. 2019Wa38 reported E(n){-lab} directly.      
 34SI3cDN 2005Ti11 reported the E(level) of {+35}Si neutron-emitting levels.    
 34SI4cDN Evaluators deduced neutron center-of-mass energies                    
